import ../../../../dynlex-ui/testing/driver.dl
import ../../../editor/source_tools.dl
import ../../../editor/source_panes.dl

appearance source appearance:
    height is 160

document editors:
    source pane "Studio" containing "β alpha\nbeta" using source appearance

to [answer contextual action query] {a pointer to UI source query:query} [with] {a pointer to JSON value:result}:
    free query's result
    set query's result to result
    set query's queued to false
    set query's ready to true

to get [the contextual source point in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set run to view's texts
    loop while run != (0 as a pointer to UI text run):
        if (run's source's element = editor's node) and (run's start = 0):
            return UI point (a UI point at (run's origin's x + (the width of (the string form of "β ") using (run's typeface)) + 1.0) and (run's origin's y - 5.0)) transformed by (run's transform)
        set run to run's next
    require condition false reporting "The context fixture did not paint its source"
    return a new UI point

set instance to an instance of editors
set window to the address of instance
set view to a UI view of window sized 900 by 600 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
set workspace to a UI source workspace in window rooted at "file:///workspace"
enable UI source tools for workspace in (the address of view)
set editor to the UI source editor labeled "Studio" in workspace
set document to editor's document
require condition ((the UI element labeled "Definition" in (editor's pane)) = (0 as UI reference)) reporting "Go to Definition remained in the permanent toolbar"
require condition ((the UI element labeled "Fixes" in (editor's pane)) = (0 as UI reference)) reporting "Quick fixes remained in the permanent toolbar"
set files to a new JSON-RPC object
configure UI source document document named "main.dl" at "file:///workspace/main.dl" prefixed by "# hidden\n" using UI CPU analysis with files files
free files
restore UI source location (editor's current) in editor in (the address of view)
set view's selection's anchor and view's selection's caret to 3
set document's diagnostic revision to document's revision
set document's diagnostic project revision to document's project's revision
update UI source tools in workspace
set tools to workspace's tools
set query to tools's quick fix's query
require condition (query != (0 as a pointer to UI source query)) reporting "The caret did not request contextual code actions"
require condition ((the JSON number named "triggerKind" in (the JSON member named "context" in (query's parameters))) = 2.0) reporting "Availability did not use an automatic code-action request"
answer contextual action query query with (a new JSON-RPC array)
update UI source tools in workspace
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (tools's quick fix's control's visible = false) reporting "An empty action list displayed a quick-fix control"
set view's selection's anchor and view's selection's caret to 4
update UI source tools in workspace
set disabled to a JSON object containing [JSON text "title" is "Unavailable fix", JSON child "disabled" is (a JSON object containing [JSON text "reason" is "Unavailable"])]
answer contextual action query (tools's quick fix's query) with (a JSON array containing [disabled])
update UI source tools in workspace
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (tools's quick fix's control's visible = false) reporting "A disabled action displayed a lightbulb"
set view's selection's anchor and view's selection's caret to 5
update UI source tools in workspace
set query to tools's quick fix's query
set edit to a JSON object containing [JSON child "range" is (an LSP range from line 1 and character 2 to line 1 and character 7), JSON text "newText" is "A"]
set action to a JSON object containing [JSON text "title" is "Replace alpha", JSON child "edit" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child "changes" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child (document's uri) is (a JSON array containing [edit])])])]
set replay to a copy of JSON-RPC node action
answer contextual action query query with (a JSON array containing [action])
require condition (automatic UI source fixes (the address of (tools's quick fix)) are current) reporting "The action result lost its current source query"
require condition (contextual UI source fixes are available in tools) reporting "An enabled action was not recognized as available"
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (contextual UI source fixes are available in tools) reporting "Updating the editor discarded the available action"
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set bulb to tools's quick fix's control
require condition (bulb's visible) reporting "An available action did not reveal the contextual lightbulb"
require condition (bulb's layout's hit bounds' width > 0.0) reporting "The visible lightbulb did not enter retained hit testing"
set point to a UI point at (bulb's layout's painted bounds' x + 12.0) and (bulb's layout's painted bounds' y + 12.0)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at (point's x) (point's y) with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
update UI source tools in workspace
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (bulb's visible) reporting "Pressing the lightbulb lost its source context before release"
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (tools's mode = 5) reporting "Clicking the lightbulb did not open its fixes"
answer contextual action query (tools's query) with (a JSON array containing [replay])
update UI source tools in workspace
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 257 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (document's source = "β A\nbeta") reporting "The contextual fix ignored Unicode or protected context"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
synchronize UI source workspace workspace at 2.0 seconds
require condition (document's source = "β alpha\nbeta") reporting "The contextual fix lost undo"
require condition (bulb's visible = false) reporting "An old lightbulb remained after an edit"
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set layout to the UI layout for element (editor's node) in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at (layout's painted bounds' x + 300.0) (layout's painted bounds' y + 15.0) with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 3 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 2 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition ((tools's mode = 6) and (tools's choices' first item's enabled = false)) reporting "Empty editor space did not expose its disabled definition action"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
set point to the contextual source point in editor in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at (point's x) (point's y) with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 3 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 2 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((tools's mode = 6) and (tools's choices' count = 1)) reporting "Right-click did not open the source context menu"
require condition (tools's navigation's phase = 0) reporting "Right-click followed a definition before choosing it"
set point to a UI point at (tools's choices' bounds' x + 20.0) and (tools's choices' bounds' y + 18.0)
queue UI input of kind 1 key 0 at (point's x) (point's y) with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 1 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 2 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (tools's navigation's phase = 1) reporting "The context action did not request a definition"
set parameters to tools's navigation's query's parameters
set position to the JSON member named "position" in parameters
require condition (((the JSON number named "line" in position) = 1.0) and ((the JSON number named "character" in position) = 2.0)) reporting "The context menu resolved the old caret instead of the clicked Unicode token"
set UI control (editor's node) read only true in window
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition (bulb's visible = false) reporting "Read-only source offered a modifying quick fix"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 299 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (tools's mode = 6) reporting "Read-only source lost its keyboard context menu"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 256 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
process UI input in (the address of view)
require condition (tools's mode = 0) reporting "Escape did not close the source context menu"
set UI control (editor's node) read only false in window
set document's diagnostic revision to document's revision
set document's diagnostic project revision to document's project's revision
update UI source tools in workspace
set query to tools's quick fix's query
set UI text of (editor's node) in window to "changed"
synchronize UI source workspace workspace at 3.0 seconds
answer contextual action query query with (a JSON array containing [a JSON object containing [JSON text "title" is "Stale action", JSON text "command" is "ignored"]])
update UI source tools in workspace
require condition ((bulb's visible = false) and (tools's mode = 0)) reporting "A late action result reopened a lightbulb for an edited document"
close the address of view
require condition (tools's quick fix's controls = (0 as a pointer to UI floating controls)) reporting "Closing the view retained contextual controls"
free UI source workspace workspace
close window
print line "Contextual fixes follow availability, Unicode selection, undo and focus; right-click and keyboard definition menus share source navigation."
